Z||000000||8Ball||09-28-2001||11:36 PM||||My Fiero has the headunit witht he slider bar so I think it had the sub at one time. I am thinking about putting one back in but want toknow what it will look like first.<BR>Also where is the amp supposed to be?<BR>Thanks||||reg||1
Z||000001||Rick 88||09-29-2001||12:51 AM||||The amp for the sub is mounted on the passenger side of the transmission tunnel under the console cover. The sub is in a large odd shape black plastic container under the passenger side of the dash, just right of the heater box. Go to "Fiero Secrets" or "World Wide Fiero Links" for pictures all the parts of the factory sub.<P>Rick 88 ||||reg||1
