Z||000005||Wolfhound||09-30-2001||08:26 AM||||8ball, Check the connector under the passenger side dash.  Two blue to two red wires. I have three cars with the factory sub. All three were disconnected here when I bought them because of a busted sub speaker.<BR>You can reconnect ot see if it works.<BR>Coy||||reg||1
